        <sh:description xml:lang="en">The status of the distribution in its maturity lifecycle, taken from the EU Distribution status authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status). The value space is closed: only concepts from this vocabulary are allowed.</sh:description>
        <sh:message xml:lang="en">status value must be a concept from the EU Distribution status table.</sh:message>
