  <sh:NodeShape rdf:about="https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Catalogue_Spatial_CV">
    <sh:description xml:lang="en">The geographical coverage of the catalogue, taken from the EU authority tables for Continent (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/continent), Countries and territories (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country) or Place (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/place), or from GeoNames. Use of these vocabularies is recommended; other values are tolerated.</sh:description>
    <sh:message xml:lang="en">spatial should include at least one value from the EU Continent, Country or Place tables, or from GeoNames.</sh:message>
