        <sh:description xml:lang="en">The spatial reference system used in the dataset, identified by a coordinate reference system URI from the OGC EPSG register. This register is not a SKOS scheme, so membership is checked by URI pattern rather than skos:inScheme. The value space is closed: only EPSG URIs are allowed.</sh:description>
        <sh:message xml:lang="en">referenceSystem value must be an OGC EPSG coordinate reference system URI.</sh:message>
