  <sh:NodeShape rdf:about="https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#RightsStatement_Conditions_CV">
    <sh:description xml:lang="en">Values state the conditions for access and usage of a Rights Statement, using the Conditions for access and usage controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/conditions-for-access-and-usage). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/conditions-for-access-and-usage/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated.</sh:description>
    <sh:message xml:lang="en">conditions for access and usage (dct:type) should include at least one concept from the Conditions for access and usage vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies.</sh:message>
